        <mxCell id="boundary" value="Prebuilt UBL bypasses generation. Changed final data returns to IC-03–09. Missing authority or profile evidence blocks.&#10;ERP owns issuance. Sending qualifies the final plan before the Article 4 issue/copy boundary; bind actual issue proof.&#10;SPEC-SEI-015 · Reconcile before resume. Return existing completed results; never repeat completed generation or sending." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
